OL,3,GNEWSAThe witch trials that were
OL,4,Adeadlier than Salem's
OL,5,
OL,6,FToday, dressing up as a witch is just a
OL,7,Fbit of Halloween fun, but in the past
OL,8,Fthere was a real belief in magic, and
OL,9,Fsorcery accusations could result in
OL,10,Fbrutality and death.
OL,12,F"There were more than five times as
OL,13,Fmany witchcraft trials and executions
OL,14,Fin Essex as there were in Salem and we
OL,15,Fjust don't talk about them at all,"
OL,16,Fsaid Emma Wardall, the founder of the
OL,17,FEssex Witch Museum.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
