OL,3,GNEWSAThe witch trials that were
OL,4,Adeadlier than Salem's
OL,5,
OL,6,FWardall said 107 people were executed
OL,7,Fand 47 died in prison in Essex between
OL,8,F1542 and 1736; during the infamous
OL,9,FSalem witch trials (1692-93) in
OL,10,FMassachusetts, US, 19 victims were
OL,11,Fhanged.
OL,13,FSo, why did the "witch county" produce
OL,14,Fso many victims?
